{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cShowdown Next Week!\u201d is a story about finding different ways to protect a village from the Demon Lord\u2019s invasion.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Hana, a resident of a small village.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just learned that the Demon King will invade the village next week. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can\u2019t abandon the village where your precious friends live!!\u00a0Can you protect the village within a week?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111190/extras/5a64ae708dd4dd7659622a2d30daac39.poster.avif?t=1763372864\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111190/extras/5a64ae708dd4dd7659622a2d30daac39.webm?t=1763372864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111190/extras/5a64ae708dd4dd7659622a2d30daac39.mp4?t=1763372864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your only action is to choose a location to investigate. \u3000</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hana cannot defeat the Demon King by force. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- She must explore the village and find clues to protect it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find the right path to defend the village. \u3000</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use the clues you discover from each location to decide where to investigate next. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0For example... You\u2019ve heard that a festival will take place at the plaza tomorrow \u2014 maybe someone will be there. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The result depends on your seven days of exploration. \u3000</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Will you defeat the Demon King? Form a peace treaty? Or perhaps find another way? Protect the village in many different ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111190/extras/98ab076699161f33e6429d1a99cc5ea4.poster.avif?t=1763372864\" width=1170 height=417 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111190/extras/98ab076699161f33e6429d1a99cc5ea4.webm?t=1763372864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes on your own, sometimes with your companions\u2019 help, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there are many ways to stop the Demon Lord. Find the clues and protect the village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111190/extras/5cbf18b76b71679ee3255a6200e59530.avif?t=1763372864\" width=516 height=280 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-10 different endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Playtime: about 1 hour to 2 hour (for full completion)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The drinks here taste great!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4111190/b895324ec6db743f2c3600c7b2c4f75f85a04481.jpg"},{"name":"Since I liked it, shall I leave now?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4111190/1ea2dda0d4983289511bd4cb97d93ce771555bde.jpg"},{"name":"Well then, shall we go?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4111190/923534fe38ce7dbb59aa30c52c60c2796c338e75.jpg"},{"name":":D !!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4111190/732a204d9f6e68b1d69f5f3bcf580c6ff313d007.jpg"},{"name":"I\u2019m looking forward to tomorrow, Hana.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4111190/e8965bd29cdcda5886e20cad926666ff84995fcc.jpg"},{"name":"I will obey your command. ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4111190/9a7c1eff4b0aa867ce75f0ba45df23fa2d06be6c.jpg"},{"name":"That form is also me!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4111190/c0c4b8deaecb3b755d1f4d711f1621cbe65237d3.jpg"},{"name":"Let\u2019s play again tomorrow..!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4111190/7e11c8db6163129143473d41fefacceec216e10b.jpg"},{"name":"This is... dangerous.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4111190/b035add921f2737a23463d9cdfd20730c76d21cb.jpg"},{"name":"The more I learn, the more curious I get~","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4111190/aa2af60fedf5ffbe5181c67cbe61861dbc3be3f6.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4111190?t=1763372864","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4111190?t=1763372864","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111190/8f04f54fa29ca15d16b1dcdfb1541e004c672cf5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763372864","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111190/8f04f54fa29ca15d16b1dcdfb1541e004c672cf5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763372864","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"C